    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but what if it's not temporary though? what if this is just how it is now? you talk about \"light\" and \"fighting\" but it feels like people just use those words to guilt you into staying in a situation that's clearly broken. if everything is just a cycle of pain, isn't there a kind of peace in just... letting go of the struggle entirely?",
